            <p class="hero-desc" data-i18n="hero_desc">
              With 25+ years of experience, Sri Durgaa Clinical Laboratory provides reliable diagnostic testing with a commitment to accuracy, quality and patient care.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-btn-group">
              <a href="#tests" class="btn btn-primary">
